  "body": "## Change and scope\n\nFreestanding `#840`-style priced obstruction under [#1898](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/1898) at `(b,a,x)=(38,2,2)`. Names one-repeat companions of the partitioned `(3,5)` and `(4,4)` Hamilton layers at `Q=8`. Answers the remaining one-repeat companion question after [#2851](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2851) / pending `independent-walks-onerepeat-8q` `(2,6)`: do one-repeat layers on `(3,5)` or `(4,4)` improve on distinct-label floors `R=98` / `R=100`?\n\n| Dual schedule | Covering pairs | Exact min R | Tariff floor (X\u22650) | Undercuts 436? | Beats distinct? |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---|---|\n| Distinct `(3,5)` (#2851) | 10416000 | **98** | \u2265500 | no | \u2014 |\n| One-repeat `(3,5)` (this) | **2499840** | **112** | **\u2265528** | **no** | **no** |\n| Distinct `(4,4)` (#2851) | 14165760 | **100** | \u2265504 | no | \u2014 |\n| One-repeat\u00d7distinct `(4,4)` (this) | **1666560** | **112** | **\u2265528** | **no** | **no** |\n| One-repeat\u00d7one-repeat `(4,4)` | **0** | \u2014 | \u2014 | \u2014 | \u2014 |\n\nLength-3 cannot host a one-repeat (closed zero edge). Abstract tariff `38\u00b78+2\u00b7112=528>436`.\n\n**Scoped obstruction / priced alphabet; no new kappa.** Leave-alone through [#2851](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2851) / [#2846](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2846) was not reopened.\n\n## Result\n\nPackage: `research/independent-walks-onerepeat-35-44/`.\nTip: `8bd3d2985cfaef59d800409a283b2fbca15a4b73`.\n\nExact: one-repeat min R **112** on both shapes (tariff floor **528**); no undercut of 436; does not beat distinct 98/100.\n\n## Validation\n\n```sh\npython3.12 -I -B research/independent-walks-onerepeat-35-44/verify.py\npython3.12 -I -O -B research/independent-walks-onerepeat-35-44/verify.py\npython3.12 -I -B research/independent-walks-onerepeat-35-44/independent.py\npython3.12 -I -B research/independent-walks-onerepeat-35-44/test_package.py\npython3.12 -B scripts/research_package.py --package research/independent-walks-onerepeat-35-44\n```\n\nExpected:\n\n```text\nPASS_INDEPENDENT_WALKS_ONEREPEAT_35_44_OBSTRUCTION one_repeat_35_min_R=112 one_repeat_44_min_R=112 ... tariff_floor=528 ... no_new_kappa\nPASS_INDEPENDENT_WALKS_ONEREPEAT_35_44 covering_35=2499840 covering_44=1666560 ... tariff_floor=528 ... no_new_kappa\nPASS_INDEPENDENT_WALKS_ONEREPEAT_35_44_PACKAGE_TESTS groups=6\nPASS_REGISTERED_RESEARCH_PACKAGE research/independent-walks-onerepeat-35-44 outcome=completed\n```\n\nDefault verify is read-only. Admission uses `need()`; `-O` also passes.\n\n## Overlap and credit\n\nClosest prior: [#2851](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2851) (distinct partitioned Q=8), pending `independent-walks-onerepeat-8q` (one-repeat `(2,6)`), [#2846](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2846), [#2779](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2779). Freestanding `(3,5)`/`(4,4)` one-repeat layer; no competing open PR at refresh.\n\nCredit the mutable-source / #2851 / onerepeat-8q / #2779 / PR1898 lineage. Prepared by Wentao Li ([VictorLiwentao](https://github.com/VictorLiwentao), [@Is__Victor](https://x.com/Is__Victor)) with substantial AI assistance, under Apache-2.0.",
